That's your problem. /home/remaster/KNOPPIX is just a shell script, not a root filesystem. You have no /bin, /lib, /etc — nothing to chroot into.

What you actually need for a Knoppix remaster:

The real root filesystem is the knoppix compressed image from the CD:
